Chat_SNN source notice

This inference-only extraction is derived from a local working copy of
PhaseSNN (upstream: https://github.com/JLU-Solar/PhaseSNN).
The upstream repository declares Apache License 2.0; its LICENSE is retained.
The local source contains uncommitted modifications and additional files;
upstream HEAD 92a0a0c0e6b1751ca2f9aea175e35d368c77488e is provenance only,
not a claim that all extracted code is identical to that upstream commit.

Hadamard helpers originate from QuaRot (https://github.com/spcl/QuaRot)
and were adapted from QuIP# (https://github.com/Cornell-RelaxML/quip-sharp),
as acknowledged in the original helper source. These attributions are retained.
The CUDA fast-hadamard-transform project is an external dependency with its
own license; its source is not redistributed in this repository.

Changes in this extraction:
- Keep the T=16 saved-model multi-turn inference path and Qwen Phase operators.
- Remove training, calibration, evaluation, search, Llama, and unused imports.
- Preserve runtime layer paths, FSNeuron calculations, and checkpoint keys.
- Require an explicit local --model-path and use the active Python environment.
- Rebuild neurons from the checkpoint; omit the external retrain.pth path.
- Keep only the 140-order Hadamard matrix needed by this 1.5B checkpoint.
- Validate neuron keys before accepting a saved model; do not rotate it again.

